      "focal_uid": 1,
      "title": "The world edges away from the dollar",
      "insight": "As countries \u2014 led by the BRICS bloc \u2014 try to trade and hold reserves outside the US dollar, they lean on gold, and that pull runs into Chinese buying and the price. Geopolitical friction and inflation feed the urge to de-dollarize, which is why this sits at the busy centre of the gold map \u2014 the slow-burn structural bid under the market.",
